# Path ownership.
#
# The pipeline and the template pin carry owners, so the gates cannot be
# changed by the same review that changes the code they guard. Replace the
# placeholder with the team or the accounts that maintain this repository; the
# settings tool checks that every path below has an owner, not who it is.

* @OWNER

# The pipeline, the settings declaration, and the ownership file itself.
/.github/ @OWNER

# The template pin and the generated file lock. Changing either moves every
# generated file in the repository.
/.template.yaml @OWNER
/template.lock @OWNER
